The HTTP server is stateless and speaks MCP 2026-07-28 as well as the 2025-era protocol. It no longer issues `Mcp-Session-Id`, and `GET` and `DELETE` on `/mcp` answer `405`. It now binds to `HOST`, default `127.0.0.1`; set `HOST=0.0.0.0` in containers. Browser requests from origins other than localhost need `PLONE_MCP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS`. @Tishasoumya-02
